going forward.

7
00:00:19,060 --> 00:00:20,061
Mmm.

8
00:00:20,687 --> 00:00:22,897
I knew I didn't want to pursue Bo.

9
00:00:24,065 --> 00:00:26,317
I've decided I'm going to
let him know how I feel today.

10
00:00:26,818 --> 00:00:27,652
Mmm-hmm.

11
00:00:31,990 --> 00:00:35,452
I think you have some
great qualities as a person…

12
00:00:35,535 --> 00:00:37,620
- Mmm.
- …that Ari and Tai-chan don't have.

13
00:00:37,704 --> 00:00:40,165
Mmm-hmm. I thought
you were going to turn me down.

14
00:00:40,248 --> 00:00:41,124
Mmm?

15
00:00:41,916 --> 00:00:43,585
I just wanted to be direct.

16
00:00:48,173 --> 00:00:50,550
I want to be alone.

17
00:00:55,889 --> 00:00:58,433
<i>Being super popular can be rough.</i>

18
00:00:58,516 --> 00:00:59,601
<i>It's a pain.</i>

19
00:01:06,399 --> 00:01:08,443
BRING ON THE LOVE

20
00:01:08,526 --> 00:01:10,445
Man, this is pretty tough.

21
00:01:12,238 --> 00:01:13,281
You heard the same?

22
00:01:14,365 --> 00:01:15,909
She's keeping you hanging?

23
00:01:15,992 --> 00:01:18,119
Like, not giving you
a clear, definitive answer?

24
00:01:18,203 --> 00:01:20,330
Yeah, today, she was basically like,

25
00:01:21,790 --> 00:01:24,250
"I was going to tell you
to give up on me."

26
00:01:24,334 --> 00:01:25,210
Right.

27
00:01:25,794 --> 00:01:29,255
"I was going to tell you
to find someone else," and then she said…

28
00:01:30,840 --> 00:01:34,135
She was kind of like,
"Mm", like she wasn't sure.

29
00:01:34,219 --> 00:01:35,720
- She left it at that?
- Yeah.

30
00:01:35,804 --> 00:01:37,472
- That's so vague.
- So vague.

31
00:01:38,181 --> 00:01:41,476
She's playing nice with you.
She's playing nice with Ari.

32
00:01:42,352 --> 00:01:46,064
She can keep doing that, but she's going
to have to make a choice sooner or later.

33
00:01:46,147 --> 00:01:46,981
True.

34
00:01:48,817 --> 00:01:52,153
But still,
it must be tough for Hikaru too.

35
00:01:52,237 --> 00:01:53,738
- With three of us.
- I mean, she's popular.

36
00:01:53,822 --> 00:01:54,656
Yeah.

37
00:01:55,240 --> 00:01:58,368
I guess that we should
just be cool with that.

38
00:01:58,451 --> 00:02:00,078
I'm not popular, so I don't get it.

39
00:02:00,161 --> 00:02:02,247
Me neither. I don't get it.

40
00:02:02,330 --> 00:02:04,833
I just don't think it's right
to keep leading people on.

41
00:02:05,333 --> 00:02:08,253
If she hasn't decided yet,
then she should just say that.

42
00:02:08,336 --> 00:02:10,755
"Sorry, but I haven't made up my mind."

43
00:02:11,923 --> 00:02:13,842
I'm gonna go ask what's bothering her.

44
00:02:17,679 --> 00:02:19,597
SMOKERS' LOUNGE

45
00:02:19,681 --> 00:02:22,517
Bo and I are both thinking about a lot.

46
00:02:22,600 --> 00:02:24,352
And I'm sure Ari is as well.

47
00:02:24,978 --> 00:02:26,896
I mean, I guess I just want to know

48
00:02:27,689 --> 00:02:29,649
how you truly feel, Hikaru.

49
00:02:29,732 --> 00:02:32,110
We get that all of us haven't spent
that much time together.

50
00:02:32,986 --> 00:02:35,405
so, of course,
we get that it's gotta be tough

51
00:02:35,488 --> 00:02:37,532
for you to choose between us so quickly,

52
00:02:38,408 --> 00:02:40,660
but, Ari and I are both thinking, like,

53
00:02:40,743 --> 00:02:43,037
if you were in our shoes,
you'd feel the same, right?

54
00:02:43,872 --> 00:02:47,208
Like, if you're telling two guys
that you felt the same about them.

55
00:02:47,292 --> 00:02:50,795
I told you that I was
interested in you, Tai-chan,

56
00:02:50,879 --> 00:02:53,339
but I didn't say that to anyone else.

57
00:02:54,799 --> 00:02:55,633
Mmm.

58
00:02:57,260 --> 00:02:58,928
- And so--
- But then, what?

59
00:02:59,012 --> 00:03:00,013
At this point,

60
00:03:00,889 --> 00:03:03,641
I thought maybe I should just see
how things go for a few days.

61
00:03:03,725 --> 00:03:04,559
Right.

62
00:03:05,476 --> 00:03:08,938
Honestly, if I don't stand a chance,
you could just say it, right now.

63
00:03:09,022 --> 00:03:11,649
For real. Like, "Right now,
I'm leaning toward Ari--"

64
00:03:11,733 --> 00:03:13,735
I'm being totally honest
with you, I swear.

65
00:03:18,031 --> 00:03:20,950
We should bring Ari in
so we can all talk together.

66
00:03:21,034 --> 00:03:21,951
- Right now.
- Okay.

67
00:03:23,161 --> 00:03:24,495
LOVE DINER

68
00:03:24,579 --> 00:03:27,415
- I wanted to talk to you, Maririn.
- Sure.

69
00:03:27,498 --> 00:03:30,084
You know, I definitely felt like
we could hit it off.

70
00:03:30,168 --> 00:03:31,878
- Mmm-hmm.
- Let's toast.

71
00:03:31,961 --> 00:03:33,046
Yeah. Nice.

72
00:03:35,131 --> 00:03:35,965
So--

73
00:03:36,966 --> 00:03:40,261
I mean, I had that feeling too,
like we could hit it off.

74
00:03:40,345 --> 00:03:41,512
I also felt that.

75
00:03:41,596 --> 00:03:44,515
What is it? Tell me. You can tell me.

76
00:03:44,599 --> 00:03:45,642
- I will, of course.
- Okay.

77
00:03:49,437 --> 00:03:50,772
Gimme your hand?

78
00:03:51,522 --> 00:03:54,317
- What's wrong? Are you stressed?
- No, it's just--

79
00:03:56,611 --> 00:03:58,071
- I mean…
- Mmm-hmm.

80
00:03:58,154 --> 00:04:00,823
I want to stay strong, as a man, you know?

81
00:04:01,991 --> 00:04:04,744
- And I want to commit to one person.
- Yeah.

82
00:04:05,787 --> 00:04:08,998
You know, it's not like
you can just flip back and forth, right?

83
00:04:09,082 --> 00:04:10,291
Mmm-hmm.

84
00:04:10,375 --> 00:04:14,462
And, so, I've spent some time
with Hikaru, you know?

85
00:04:14,545 --> 00:04:15,588
Yeah.

86
00:04:15,672 --> 00:04:17,382
- I've shown her I love her.
- Yeah.

87
00:04:17,465 --> 00:04:19,592
- I can totally see that.
- Yeah.

88
00:04:19,676 --> 00:04:21,678
I mean, I've been showing
how much I love her,

89
00:04:21,761 --> 00:04:24,555
and still don't think
she's feeling it, so I feel stuck.

90
00:04:27,058 --> 00:04:28,726
Anyone would feel that way.

91
00:04:28,810 --> 00:04:29,894
- Anyone would.
- Yeah.

92
00:04:30,895 --> 00:04:33,106
- And so--
- Hey, guys.

93
00:04:36,234 --> 00:04:38,111
Could you give us a few more minutes?

94
00:04:40,071 --> 00:04:42,740
It's important.
We really need to talk. Now.

95
00:04:43,408 --> 00:04:44,617
Scary.

96
00:04:44,701 --> 00:04:46,995
- It is scary.
- Big sister's pissed.

97
00:04:48,121 --> 00:04:49,622
I need you to wait a sec.

98
00:04:52,083 --> 00:04:53,334
Just a minute or two.

99
00:04:53,876 --> 00:04:56,170
- Is it really that important?
- Yeah.

100
00:04:56,754 --> 00:04:59,048
- Super important?
- It's super important to me.

101
00:04:59,757 --> 00:05:00,967
