102
00:05:02,677 --> 00:05:05,054
- The guys are so rattled.
- Come on, guys!

103
00:05:05,138 --> 00:05:06,306
They're just speechless.

104
00:05:06,389 --> 00:05:08,808
- Those women are strong.
- Why aren't they saying anything?

105
00:05:08,891 --> 00:05:11,185
Ari, come on, you gotta step in.

106
00:05:33,082 --> 00:05:35,335
- Hey. You okay? You sure?
- Yeah, I'm good.

107
00:05:35,418 --> 00:05:36,586
- Sorry.
- Don't worry about it.

108
00:05:36,669 --> 00:05:37,587
- Seriously.
- Yeah.

109
00:05:37,670 --> 00:05:39,964
- To me, this feels like the real Ari.
- Right.

110
00:05:40,048 --> 00:05:44,552
It's actually weird when you're hyped up.
So, you don't have to pretend, okay?

111
00:05:44,635 --> 00:05:47,638
I mean it. Seriously,
you don't have to fake a smile.

