it'd be good to hear her side of it.

140
00:07:47,925 --> 00:07:49,552
- Got it.
- Let's all talk.

141
00:07:49,635 --> 00:07:51,387
- Sure.
- And say what we feel.

142
00:08:11,324 --> 00:08:13,242
When you talked to us individually…

143
00:08:13,326 --> 00:08:14,285
Mmm-hmm.

144
00:08:14,368 --> 00:08:16,412
…you said,
"You three should compare notes.

145
00:08:16,496 --> 00:08:18,706
- I'm sure it'll make sense after that."
- Right.

146
00:08:18,789 --> 00:08:22,835
Then we talked, we were like,
"Wait, none of this actually adds up."

147
00:08:22,919 --> 00:08:26,422
That's when Ari, Bo, and I
started to doubt everything, you know?

148
00:08:26,506 --> 00:08:27,423
Mmm.

149
00:08:27,507 --> 00:08:29,509
They're being so kind about this.

150
00:08:29,592 --> 00:08:31,093
- They really are.
- Hard to believe

151
00:08:31,177 --> 00:08:32,386
these are the same people.

152
00:08:32,470 --> 00:08:33,304
I know.

153
00:08:35,473 --> 00:08:40,061
You basically told me that
you weren't focused on Bo anymore.

154
00:08:40,144 --> 00:08:40,978
Mmm.

155
00:08:41,062 --> 00:08:44,440
And that you might
narrow it down to just me and Taisei.

156
00:08:44,524 --> 00:08:46,192
- Mmm.
- That's what you said.

157
00:08:46,776 --> 00:08:48,986
- It seemed like you'd made a decision.
- Mmm-hmm.

158
00:08:49,070 --> 00:08:53,115
That's how it felt. But when I talked
to Bo, it didn't sound like that at all.

159
00:08:54,992 --> 00:08:55,868
Mmm.

160
00:08:55,952 --> 00:08:57,703
He was like,
"Wait, she never told me that."

161
00:08:57,787 --> 00:08:58,663
Right.

162
00:08:59,455 --> 00:09:03,042
- He hadn't totally backed off--
- Because I wasn't ready to tell him yet.

163
00:09:03,125 --> 00:09:04,835
He said,
"I want to show you my true self,"

164
00:09:04,919 --> 00:09:07,505
and I said, "Okay."
I wanted to think about it.

165
00:09:07,588 --> 00:09:09,799
