171
00:09:30,945 --> 00:09:32,655
You don't think of me romantically,

172
00:09:32,738 --> 00:09:34,699
but you came to get chocolate
from me first.

173
00:09:35,366 --> 00:09:37,285
And after that, I was like, "What?"

174
00:09:38,536 --> 00:09:40,162
And I ended up thinking that…

175
00:09:41,372 --> 00:09:42,206
Mmm.

176
00:09:42,290 --> 00:09:43,958
…that you liked Taisei more than me.

177
00:09:45,710 --> 00:09:49,922
That's when my trust issues started.
Like, what is it that you actually want?

178
00:09:50,006 --> 00:09:52,550
Each of you has something
that gives me pause.

179
00:09:53,342 --> 00:09:55,761
- Mmm.
- With Bo, it's the domestic violence.

180
00:09:56,762 --> 00:10:00,266
With you, I'm worried
we wouldn't move past friendship.

181
00:10:00,349 --> 00:10:03,728
And with Tai-chan,
it was the way he talked about things.

182
00:10:04,312 --> 00:10:06,647
- You said it's gotten better.
- He was wishy-washy.

183
00:10:06,731 --> 00:10:09,317
- Yeah, I told you that.
- So now you're interested in him the most?

184
00:10:09,400 --> 00:10:13,487
I wouldn't say "the most."
I can just see him as a man now, you know?

185
00:10:13,571 --> 00:10:16,574
- Which means you don't see me as a man.
- I'm trying to see you as one.

186
00:10:16,657 --> 00:10:18,284
- Okay.
- I'm trying to, I want to.

187
00:10:18,367 --> 00:10:21,495
But as of right now, you clearly
like Taisei the most.

188
00:10:21,579 --> 00:10:24,290
- Romantically, you're leaning toward him.
- I do see him as a man, yeah.

189
00:10:24,373 --> 00:10:25,916
Then shouldn't you just go for him?

190
00:10:29,253 --> 00:10:32,590
I'm just saying, I didn't know
you thought of Taisei romantically,

191
00:10:32,673 --> 00:10:34,133
that you're the most interested in him.

192
00:10:34,717 --> 00:10:35,760
Mmm.

193
00:10:35,843 --> 00:10:38,888
I feel like you're trying
to keep your options open.

194
00:10:39,597 --> 00:10:41,223
- Yeah.
- So that's what you think of me?

195
00:10:42,016 --> 00:10:43,976
Basically, that's what I thought.

196
00:10:44,602 --> 00:10:46,103
That's exactly what I wanted to avoid.

197
00:10:46,187 --> 00:10:49,940
I know. But to be honest, that's what
it looks like from our side of it.

198
00:10:50,024 --> 00:10:51,067
Mmm.

199
00:10:52,610 --> 00:10:54,070
That is super frustrating.

200
00:10:56,197 --> 00:10:58,741
But why? I mean, at least
your feelings are clear, aren't they?

201
00:10:58,824 --> 00:11:01,369
- What? No, not at all.
- Sure they are.

202
00:11:01,952 --> 00:11:04,872
To me, it feels like I don't even know

203
00:11:05,623 --> 00:11:08,584
what it means to "be interested."
I'm confused.

204
00:11:11,045 --> 00:11:14,340
I'm kind of starting to wonder
if my feelings are just an illusion

205
00:11:14,423 --> 00:11:16,509
because of the circumstances of the show.

206
00:11:17,385 --> 00:11:20,179
I don't even know what it means
to like someone anymore.

207
00:11:21,472 --> 00:11:22,306
You know?

208
00:11:23,849 --> 00:11:25,267
Mmm, the setup…

209
00:11:26,602 --> 00:11:28,229
is messing with my brain.

210
00:11:32,316 --> 00:11:35,653
What do you mean? Are you saying
you don't think you can fall in love here?

211
00:11:36,487 --> 00:11:37,488
Hmm…

212
00:11:39,115 --> 00:11:40,825
Yeah, I'm not sure if I can.

213
00:11:43,536 --> 00:11:44,370
I see.

214
00:11:49,709 --> 00:11:52,002
My feelings are constantly changing.

215
00:11:56,298 --> 00:11:59,885
I'm worried that
I won't be able to find clarity here.

216
00:12:04,014 --> 00:12:05,641
I seriously don't know anymore.

217
00:12:11,522 --> 00:12:12,606
Hmm.

